<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Toyota -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Toyota -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.27		vs	   45.43</p>
<p> Operating   loss 682    million    vs   loss 601    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 731    million    vs   loss 768    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 745    million    vs   loss 782    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 67.81 yen	  vs    loss 71.12 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Toyota Motor Co Ltd is a car dealer directly managed by Toyota Motor Corp.</p>
